  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_2873.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La noche de este viernes ha sido la cena de personas socias y acompa&ntilde;antes en el trinquete municipal de Onda en Artesa. Ha habido tres jugadas del tradicional bingo, adem&aacute;s de la habitual foto de la Penya L&#39;Orinal, y verbena con la orquesta Modenna hasta bien entrada la madrugada.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2837.jpg\" alt=\"img_2837\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2839.jpg\" alt=\"img_2839\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2840.jpg\" alt=\"img_2840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2841.jpg\" alt=\"img_2841\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2842.jpg\" alt=\"img_2842\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2843.jpg\" alt=\"img_2843\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2844.jpg\" alt=\"img_2844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2845.jpg\" alt=\"img_2845\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparfestesartesa14/img_2846.jpg\" alt=\